WEBVTT

00:41:26.939 --> 00:41:31.002
when it comes to your company
having gone up in flames.

00:41:31.026 --> 00:41:33.962
Number two, you can't just
move to a new house

00:41:33.986 --> 00:41:35.803
without talking about the old one.

00:41:36.137 --> 00:41:39.602
You have to account for where you spent
those three or four years,

00:41:39.626 --> 00:41:42.411
and so it's almost like
you are forced to wear a badge

00:41:42.435 --> 00:41:45.268
with a bunch of stigma attached to it.

00:41:46.342 --> 00:41:47.554
DF: Yeah, absolutely.

00:41:47.578 --> 00:41:52.856
You know, if you were in the middle
of a job hunt in that process

00:41:52.880 --> 00:41:56.202
you went from being highly coveted one day

00:41:56.226 --> 00:42:00.448
to needing to explain
why that happened the next,